WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Mark a 6 cm curve on framed scrap fabric.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.600
Lay the gold cord along the curve.
Leave a short tail at each end.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:12.800
Bring a fine needle up beside the cord.
Cross over it and take the needle down opposite.

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.700
Use closer stitches at the tightest part.
Place them 3–4 mm apart on gentler sections.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.000
Secure each end with two close stitches.
Fasten the fine thread on the back.
